{"id": "official:sentence:dd2da7e8-fba7-4df9-8f16-8bf3be0ad098", "text": "这种昆虫在英语中叫什么？", "shortMeaning": "这种虫英语叫什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:decd7dd1-8a50-4536-9a95-9dff2e69130b", "text": "这种杂志对年轻人有害。", "shortMeaning": "这类杂志对年轻人有害。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
