{"id": "official:sentence:6e3755d9-0173-47c1-9986-d8bf34dd2945", "text": "这种款式的帽子现在很流行。", "shortMeaning": "这款帽子现在很时兴。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8b34a168-3b61-4d3d-935e-8cbf589e0913", "text": "这种比附叫做“牛头不对马嘴”。", "shortMeaning": "这种乱套叫“牛头不对马嘴”。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6dd32f3d-4c2a-4341-b922-5f5050d4f92e", "text": "这种水晶显然很贵。", "shortMeaning": "这种水晶显然不便宜。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:107d6e1f-d686-418e-ad45-cf967bb1feb6", "text": "这种理论不能自圆其说。", "shortMeaning": "这套说法自己圆不上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ed8966e8-9db5-4ef8-8197-c0985133ff3d", "text": "这种科技的优势是什么？", "shortMeaning": "这种技术好在哪儿？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:83da58fe-65c3-4663-9c60-c00b3bf36cad", "text": "这种秘密总有一天会被揭露的。", "shortMeaning": "这种秘密总有一天会揭出来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e8c26aba-2b1b-4d9b-a2c1-106df4f86acd", "text": "这种茶对我而言不够甜。", "shortMeaning": "这茶我觉得不够甜。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:391bf990-0a37-44f7-8065-1d14e71a4390", "text": "这种药会减轻你的疼痛。", "shortMeaning": "这药能减轻你的疼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:abfdab77-438e-42f9-8052-02ffa4a74ffb", "text": "这种药我吃了好多年了。", "shortMeaning": "这药我吃了好些年了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ef9c2bb1-7809-43f2-a9df-e554381046b9", "text": "这种药片对心脏有疗效。", "shortMeaning": "这种药片对心脏有好处。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8d5d207d-8518-4061-8cb5-59303327fdb3", "text": "这种药物只能外用。", "shortMeaning": "这种药只能外用。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:059cd579-adab-40fe-b207-265b1e9c5bd6", "text": "这种药物有很小的可能性引起皮疹。", "shortMeaning": "这种药有很小的可能引起皮疹。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b476b507-ad06-4d2c-a565-8130144d3648", "text": "这种葡萄酒比我们之前尝过的那种有更多果香。", "shortMeaning": "这酒比先前尝的那种果香更浓。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e2460755-825e-4c15-a9fc-a0653d72af31", "text": "这种行为叫做 “打小报告”。", "shortMeaning": "这种做法就是背后告状。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a4805c04-894a-4fc1-8244-e56e15144035", "text": "这种行为可能造成意外。", "shortMeaning": "这种做法可能出意外。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c18b2ca9-3b63-483f-8095-21e24d252e21", "text": "这种表达方式很中国化。", "shortMeaning": "这种说法很中国味。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:50c094f7-3c3f-4988-b95b-39a0da2ef54d", "text": "这种说法其实有点可疑。", "shortMeaning": "这话其实有点可疑。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:287ce30b-ef24-48a0-a03f-8ed104d04870", "text": "这种说法没有任何依据。", "shortMeaning": "这话毫无根据。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:356c66ca-1c26-4cf7-8ba6-cba3f6896e6f", "text": "这种错误很容易被人忽视。", "shortMeaning": "这种错很容易被漏掉。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b0b9e104-e035-4308-be2d-aa10f8090e9e", "text": "这种问题的答案倒没有绝对的对错。", "shortMeaning": "这类问题的答案没有绝对对错。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f819875d-4c30-4865-b075-143c8494b59b", "text": "这种问题该有补救办法。", "shortMeaning": "这类问题该有补救的法子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:42f41a8d-90d9-4266-8b11-d3fed0010e5d", "text": "这种非物质文化遗产几乎失传了。", "shortMeaning": "这种非物质文化遗产差点失传。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bf4ae54a-c086-49dc-9f57-e15369549cf4", "text": "这种音乐叫人昏昏欲睡。", "shortMeaning": "这种音乐听得人犯困。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b8853cba-7bae-400d-8311-75c9ca6a4ebd", "text": "这种颜色比那种稍微深一点。", "shortMeaning": "这颜色比那种略深一点。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cea358a9-bad0-4f67-95c5-1fc9c146027b", "text": "这秘密别跟任何人说。", "shortMeaning": "这秘密别跟任何人讲。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
