{"id": "official:sentence:45edc550-b40c-48a9-b0ed-8947cc1425b9", "text": "这笔账单漏洞百出。", "shortMeaning": "这笔账破绽百出。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9c4ca663-41f2-4402-ad2e-08a19dc7434b", "text": "这简直是太可惜了，他们没有买火险。", "shortMeaning": "太可惜了，他们没买火险。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:de36378d-8caa-40ff-99d6-2b963ee6c80f", "text": "这箱子是空的，里面什么也没有。", "shortMeaning": "箱子空的，里头什么都没有。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
