{"id": "official:sentence:8178b252-e1eb-4bec-a75c-1c0044613010", "text": "这老人瞎了一只眼。", "shortMeaning": "这老人一只眼瞎了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:63b6ba16-5499-4402-b33e-871f947962a1", "text": "这臭味真是令人作呕。", "shortMeaning": "这臭味真叫人想吐。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8a654739-0c0b-4f2f-9b65-afe70c26566e", "text": "这艘船太大，没法通过运河。", "shortMeaning": "这船太大，过不了运河。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
