{"id": "official:sentence:9e1ed898-da63-4ea4-b244-0f15d9e078d0", "text": "这药会让你舒服些。", "shortMeaning": "这药能让你好受些。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9d30eb9f-7e52-4c06-a831-08d42552df47", "text": "这表明了地方领导恢复地区卓越水平的雄心。", "shortMeaning": "这说明地方领导想让本地重回昔日水准。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1e4816bb-0ed9-4cb2-b913-63a70b39bfc7", "text": "这表明它们注意听了顾客的需要。", "shortMeaning": "这说明它们听了顾客的需求。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:53cc9055-426b-4a9a-87cb-f97fbf19b158", "text": "这表明幸福和悲痛之间只隔着看法。", "shortMeaning": "这说明幸福与悲痛只隔着一念。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:26a96ee3-1157-4e3d-8e1e-405a956ead4f", "text": "这被认为是一件大事。", "shortMeaning": "这被视为一件大事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:09ca1e87-c1c3-4568-a5b6-95121bca3430", "text": "这西装好像真的很贵。", "shortMeaning": "这套西装好像真不便宜。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
