{"id": "official:sentence:f7b33e1b-6f1c-4eba-980b-b86254453e8e", "text": "这车子开起来不像从前那么好了。", "shortMeaning": "这车开起来不如以前顺。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8ff9c676-9ac6-420f-8112-cf0fd12f15a1", "text": "这辆卡车最大的载重量是5吨。", "shortMeaning": "这辆卡车最多载5吨。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9fdc84fe-c50d-4833-aa0a-723272cc679d", "text": "这辆双排气管的跑车的发动机功率好大吧！", "shortMeaning": "这辆双排气管的跑车马力真大！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4a2b4272-3b2f-4af6-a65e-1779b48cd8fb", "text": "这辆自行车属于我。", "shortMeaning": "这辆自行车是我的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f1954ed2-5345-4a1a-8ed4-da546218f08c", "text": "这辆自行车是谁的？", "shortMeaning": "这自行车是谁的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e3315e1c-d972-4057-8623-360f47d75796", "text": "这辆自行车需要修理。", "shortMeaning": "这自行车该修了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7c1f6b04-09a6-48bd-b3fc-258d3f7ebdfa", "text": "这辆车保养起来很贵。", "shortMeaning": "这车保养很费钱。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fc15f1f8-f12d-4a6b-a41c-a5c81add7db6", "text": "这辆车停在银行前。", "shortMeaning": "这辆车停在银行门口。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0de2c6ee-3e82-4e33-afdf-4e8ca42dcc51", "text": "这辆车去静安寺吗？", "shortMeaning": "这趟车到静安寺吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d2ddeace-8de1-4fee-851d-44ef6cfc4eb0", "text": "这辆车在银行前面停下来了。", "shortMeaning": "这辆车在银行前停下了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6fabbe00-c78c-4ff6-84f6-e2b7a204dd47", "text": "这辆车是区间车，到梅陇新村要回驶。", "shortMeaning": "这是区间车，到梅陇新村就折回。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:85fa9a05-6473-4de4-a867-1cb9bc164b38", "text": "这辆车是布莱恩的。", "shortMeaning": "这车归布莱恩。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:27bb1312-ab98-410c-97d9-663886765ab3", "text": "这辆车靠天然气驱动。", "shortMeaning": "这辆车烧天然气。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:532acd28-3abf-4ac4-bf0c-e74f4d5d6057", "text": "这辆迷你巴士能容纳25个人。", "shortMeaning": "这辆小巴能坐25人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:df7d8905-1427-4a02-b31b-b6320c4fed6c", "text": "这还有什么能做的？", "shortMeaning": "那还能做什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4bbd71aa-78f0-4e6d-a699-6550db076be8", "text": "这还真要等半个世纪呀。", "shortMeaning": "这真要等上半辈子了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ed61f0b3-ba69-47e9-bbdd-2f8453db38b0", "text": "这远不是一次失败，而是一次巨大的成功。", "shortMeaning": "这绝非失败，而是个大成功。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bcdff4eb-cb99-41fe-8a1f-4b4be23f82fb", "text": "这道练习题里有错误吗？", "shortMeaning": "这道练习题里有错吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e319ddb5-c0f9-400d-a786-5acec9942f53", "text": "这邮递员有些可爱。", "shortMeaning": "这邮递员有点可爱。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c765846a-3378-4666-a9bb-1865ec8cd112", "text": "这部发生在破旧不堪小镇的救赎与希望之歌，是南非选送今年奥斯卡的作品，并入围了最佳外语片五强角逐。", "shortMeaning": "这部讲破败小镇里救赎与希望的片子，是南非选送奥斯卡的作品，进了最佳外语片五强。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5f8deeb8-66f2-4347-a59b-0037a4427834", "text": "这部小说很难读懂。", "shortMeaning": "这本小说很难看懂。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:de0d8abf-a554-4e74-9649-917789e9be83", "text": "这部小说是一个著名的美国作家写的。", "shortMeaning": "这本小说是位美国名作家写的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:00ff605e-c571-46fc-9041-07a7a3bb8197", "text": "这部恐怖片很吓人，我一看就睡不着觉了。", "shortMeaning": "这恐怖片太吓人，我一看就睡不着。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e665d9c5-9e00-44c2-96de-23d8cc87d51e", "text": "这部手机和一些预装的应用一起出售。", "shortMeaning": "这部手机带一些预装应用一起卖。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:205193f1-5d1b-40ec-acdb-24d62967758b", "text": "这部机器是在法国制造的。", "shortMeaning": "这台机器是法国造的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f0414cd4-f078-4c39-a6d9-dde0ab69dc60", "text": "这部漫画登场的人物全是少女。", "shortMeaning": "这漫画里出场的人物全是少女。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:78d119f3-ca98-4063-94d9-a5b3601b6b9b", "text": "这部电影为她赢得了人气。", "shortMeaning": "这部电影给她带来了人气。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:527d29b5-8427-46fd-987f-e43e9ce68550", "text": "这部电影实在太棒了，我还想再看一遍。", "shortMeaning": "这电影太棒，我还想再看一遍。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ba4b6e38-259a-46fa-ad99-ac048c58bdbc", "text": "这部电影很无聊，最好的部分是结局。", "shortMeaning": "这电影很无聊，最好看的就数结尾。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d3486402-3abc-4aa8-ab06-ec1f67b66b7d", "text": "这部电影是我迄今为止看过的最好的一部。", "shortMeaning": "这是我至今看过最好的电影。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f49f368d-6211-43bc-b5b2-bae3607f7263", "text": "这部电影有起意思来。", "shortMeaning": "这电影越看越有意思。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:080adf93-30da-4617-978e-ae5cdde774ca", "text": "这部电影的情节构思实在是太棒了，我看了不下十遍。", "shortMeaning": "这电影情节编得真好，我看了十遍不止。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:592f245e-19e8-4d5d-bb3d-3e52c7ddafc5", "text": "这部电影真的很好看。", "shortMeaning": "这电影确实值得一看。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c701cab5-e0fb-46a2-a179-50c7182036ee", "text": "这部电影至少值得看两三遍。", "shortMeaning": "这电影至少该看两三遍。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1137cec8-2c62-462a-af16-1d2b62e8b65f", "text": "这部电影适合小孩看。", "shortMeaning": "这电影适合孩子看。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:571724f2-0808-4102-887f-65c6ea8c2e6c", "text": "这部电梯一次能运送10个人。", "shortMeaning": "这部电梯一趟能载10人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:00b21db3-388d-48dc-8e37-78bbaa8c859a", "text": "这都是咱们听说的。", "shortMeaning": "这些我们都只是听说的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:41de1231-6024-4201-853a-849fa435cdb3", "text": "这酒杯是用金做成的。", "shortMeaning": "这只酒杯是金的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:386ffe3b-d693-49f0-b268-de0615964134", "text": "这里一排都是进口面料欧版的西装。", "shortMeaning": "这一排全是进口料子的欧版西装。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bba24636-a2a9-41c5-bef5-44c3af77d01f", "text": "这里不像阿拉斯加那么冷。", "shortMeaning": "这里没阿拉斯加那么冷。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5a0f8bc6-c32f-4750-8039-2de90e10cd36", "text": "这里人太多了。咱们换个地方吧。", "shortMeaning": "这儿人太多，我们另找个地方吧。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8b9e8f09-b327-4487-8020-09b663d0dab4", "text": "这里以前有个商店。", "shortMeaning": "这儿从前有家店。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c9544994-7e0b-4336-9858-9a19137cc64d", "text": "这里你可以看到漂亮的颜色组合。", "shortMeaning": "在这儿能看到好看的颜色搭配。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fd555b9e-06d6-42b4-bb22-28e9cbbfafec", "text": "这里刚刚下过一场大雪。", "shortMeaning": "这儿刚下过一场大雪。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:27779209-e5b0-4207-a2ca-ad4ab99c581b", "text": "这里发生了一起交通事故。", "shortMeaning": "这儿出了车祸。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:523cae1b-561b-46b4-baf6-82d5a1147c29", "text": "这里只有我一个人。", "shortMeaning": "这儿就我一个人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e50403d4-6a14-4b2d-84f6-08b83b0a0568", "text": "这里夏天非常炎热。", "shortMeaning": "这儿夏天热得很。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d97adaa4-144a-455a-9929-48151ee23bfc", "text": "这里就是事故发生的地方。", "shortMeaning": "出事的地方就是这儿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1bfa8e12-e639-4097-ba3d-94734b98a4c9", "text": "这里就是我们的秘密联络点，我的代号是，海葵。", "shortMeaning": "这儿是我们的秘密接头点，我的代号叫海葵。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b50dc531-5ccd-4c1c-9d8b-e3b85317d490", "text": "这里就是我住的地方。", "shortMeaning": "我住的就是这儿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:99a0ba06-5be1-4a77-b91a-957c1ecf929b", "text": "这里是普通中学的化学实验室。", "shortMeaning": "这儿是所普通中学的化学实验室。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fa14684e-d415-44f3-aa9c-8de4cdf1237b", "text": "这里是湖最深的地方。", "shortMeaning": "湖最深的地方就在这儿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c26c5092-8f23-4a22-9eb5-b8133e57e80f", "text": "这里是西藏路、金陵路口。", "shortMeaning": "这儿是西藏路与金陵路口。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e3d353c8-54d5-4cf0-a9f5-da53867e9bde", "text": "这里曾是黑斯廷斯战役的战场。", "shortMeaning": "黑斯廷斯战役当年就在这儿打。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9d4fede9-0087-4924-9aab-00ce5095cff0", "text": "这里有一辆校车吗？", "shortMeaning": "这儿有校车吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7e15af84-fca4-45e9-8b65-c7d2854d9452", "text": "这里有人会开车吗？", "shortMeaning": "在座有谁会开车吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:137c7f58-695f-480c-82de-73eac63b5830", "text": "这里有人会说日语吗？", "shortMeaning": "这儿有会说日语的人吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:65f719b5-f2cd-4eae-8ede-8cba1fbcf8a7", "text": "这里有人会说英语吗？", "shortMeaning": "这儿有会说英语的人吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4722517f-40d4-4c44-b1a8-68cf27f4e331", "text": "这里有出租毛巾的。", "shortMeaning": "这儿有毛巾出租。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ecffc24d-808d-4e24-821d-b79bda2ba273", "text": "这里有很多货车在开。", "shortMeaning": "这儿很多货车在跑。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1eec93e7-6e92-4a2a-9e26-1a12ec360528", "text": "这里有间供儿童玩耍的房间。你可以把你的小孩带到那里。", "shortMeaning": "这儿有间儿童游戏室，你可以把孩子带过去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:972edcbf-3235-4536-bcf2-363225a55bfb", "text": "这里正在筹划建设一座发电站。", "shortMeaning": "这儿正打算建一座电站。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e68bf4c4-cd10-4853-a50d-5a2cc702765f", "text": "这里现在有了许多新建筑。", "shortMeaning": "这儿如今新楼不少。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:58cf7840-abdd-47c1-9be8-1f4717c72670", "text": "这里疼是吗？那是胃痛。", "shortMeaning": "这儿疼是吗？那是胃痛。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b555780b-4a5e-4585-b006-498cb4339f87", "text": "这里的“南翔小笼”没治了！", "shortMeaning": "这儿的“南翔小笼”好得没法说！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aa06b38f-fdf4-4424-ae7f-5c26b1faa201", "text": "这里的书店和图书馆没有外语书。", "shortMeaning": "这儿的书店和图书馆没有外文书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f98f1e2d-45ab-41a9-b15a-8ce1de3a3ffa", "text": "这里的人习惯了寒冷。", "shortMeaning": "这儿的人习惯寒冷。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a3a5411d-a71d-435a-a84f-b1c23b12e7ce", "text": "这里的夏天很潮湿，另外，冬天很干燥。", "shortMeaning": "这儿夏天潮，冬天却干。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:38bff7c2-e48f-4a8d-9c79-235acbc3d881", "text": "这里的夏天很热，另外，冬天很干燥。", "shortMeaning": "这儿夏天很热，冬天又很干。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:de8c175e-bd9d-4cd6-973c-b4ba2c1f63a7", "text": "这里的树大多数都是果树。", "shortMeaning": "这儿的树多半是果树。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3ff46c7e-d627-4440-ad79-99cab57ffe30", "text": "这里的椅子够大家做吗？", "shortMeaning": "这儿的椅子够所有人坐吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6ee12b1e-a5d8-42d5-8d22-f7eb0eddee15", "text": "这里的自然景观的特点是山非常多，而且像画一样特别美。", "shortMeaning": "这儿自然景观的特点是山极多，美得像画。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8e07b05f-5e66-4ac3-aef6-f23448313d43", "text": "这里看上去非常安全。", "shortMeaning": "这儿看着很安全。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dd987f66-e98a-495a-a7be-a492d258ad8a", "text": "这里面我有很多不懂的。", "shortMeaning": "这里面我好多都不懂。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:85dbd53c-f27f-4e58-a46c-5abde27930c6", "text": "这钥匙能打开什么？", "shortMeaning": "这钥匙能开什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b12c920f-c062-415d-ad27-fe884ad260c7", "text": "这钱你和我分了吧。", "shortMeaning": "这钱咱俩分了吧。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:26ae588f-a5b4-4bc7-b606-7e4c9942c6ee", "text": "这门怎样都打不开。", "shortMeaning": "这门怎么也打不开。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f7ec8296-648f-45f1-b1bc-8c23d34e583a", "text": "这问题不像看上去那么难。", "shortMeaning": "这问题不像看着那么难。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4b77574e-a81d-4b66-9edb-2ee196c4e3f0", "text": "这问题正在被讨论。", "shortMeaning": "这问题正在讨论。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b08ba540-9c24-48f9-88a6-541334c2ad90", "text": "这间屋子的温度是不是有点高了？", "shortMeaning": "这屋里的温度是不是有点高？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:526913aa-73c2-48ab-81b1-055340d0fcdd", "text": "这间房照不到很多阳光。", "shortMeaning": "这间屋见不着多少阳光。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:986458d9-4ffc-47b5-94c9-af92f4299d10", "text": "这间房间朝向很好。", "shortMeaning": "这间屋朝向好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:afa3ad9b-10ff-4afb-a471-a80b5e58a606", "text": "这间教室与那间隔着一堵墙。", "shortMeaning": "这间教室和那间隔着一堵墙。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:de7e6572-716a-4ea2-9203-de7921c20275", "text": "这间讲演厅很大的，而那间很小的。", "shortMeaning": "这间讲演厅很大，那间却很小。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6e59fc68-a76f-4f36-9ea1-3a07d7804680", "text": "这附近有很多值得一看的地方。", "shortMeaning": "这附近不少地方值得看。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ff530532-ed03-4ab5-b6ae-0d31a47123b9", "text": "这附近有没有可以给手机充电的地方？", "shortMeaning": "附近有能给手机充电的地方吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e4a3dff3-92d0-4c90-96bd-f39a32408dd0", "text": "这雨没有要停的迹象。", "shortMeaning": "这雨没有停的意思。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:65e9fbd8-59ef-451b-829c-adfec7ef555a", "text": "这非常清楚的表明了他没有想娶你的意图。", "shortMeaning": "这很清楚说明他没打算娶你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2e06a915-085c-4270-b5f3-5e3831299c85", "text": "这音乐值得听许多次。", "shortMeaning": "这音乐值得多听几回。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a9802da0-4fc1-48eb-a9e4-f3b613d75a0c", "text": "这顶帽子你戴太小了。", "shortMeaning": "这帽子你戴太小。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1a4d0e13-59ef-4e80-b8e5-c74111e27d32", "text": "这顶帽子对我来说太小了。", "shortMeaning": "这帽子我戴太小。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:100184c1-e119-4dde-86d6-2c0f2f7fd717", "text": "这顶帽子对我来说太紧了。", "shortMeaning": "这帽子我戴太紧。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9ab832f8-d4bf-4c15-9aed-386b401f229c", "text": "这顶帽子是你的吗？", "shortMeaning": "这帽子是你的吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a701972c-1936-4957-8744-e39a6b6af590", "text": "这顶红帽子很衬她的裙子。", "shortMeaning": "这顶红帽子很配她的裙子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7d19c3ec-a5f0-4c72-89cd-1d7557cc20b5", "text": "这项工作应该在15点完成。", "shortMeaning": "这项工作该在15点做完。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b16d0e32-c2cc-4c7d-9a66-f0fe1d7f0d66", "text": "这项法律会剥夺我们的基本权利。", "shortMeaning": "这条法律会剥夺我们的基本权利。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8ec2f20d-a7f2-4e63-8db4-b888c45eb9e0", "text": "这项运动对下背部有益。", "shortMeaning": "这项运动对下背有好处。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4660b481-3cbb-4646-9874-07d2fa36e13b", "text": "这颗牙对冷的食物敏感吗？", "shortMeaning": "这颗牙吃冷的会酸吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:391db4de-68b8-44f6-b850-3b23a15e7bb5", "text": "这颗钻石不是真的。", "shortMeaning": "这颗钻石不是真货。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:08adbad6-8c42-4b44-8976-dc7b59189dd1", "text": "这饭足够三个人吃。", "shortMeaning": "这饭够三个人吃。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:214efbee-af6f-46fc-b455-aa8be27ad969", "text": "这饺子是什么馅的啊？", "shortMeaning": "这饺子是什么馅的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c92f5983-444f-4a60-b071-3503ad6ecc17", "text": "这首曲子对我来说太难演奏了。", "shortMeaning": "这首曲子我弹不下来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3afb7831-e607-48a8-85bf-dcc71dadb5f4", "text": "这首曲子有226个小节。", "shortMeaning": "这首曲子共226个小节。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6d525924-9c7c-4864-b6c0-105d2bbf9540", "text": "这首曲子，是动漫主题曲吗？", "shortMeaning": "这首曲子是动画主题曲吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:95e48ea6-6de8-4e74-a671-78e4dc7e4050", "text": "这首歌也还可以吧？", "shortMeaning": "这首歌还算可以吧？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5ac8557a-f02b-4779-a965-47f555b744da", "text": "这首歌使我想起了我年轻的时候。", "shortMeaning": "这首歌让我想起年轻那会儿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:da4eebae-5cc1-4297-99c0-fc0480b6c942", "text": "这首歌太感人了，使我不禁流下了眼泪。", "shortMeaning": "这歌太感人，我不由得流下眼泪。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:790483a3-7c4c-447f-8354-bf32fcaf6fe3", "text": "这首歌是为她而写的。", "shortMeaning": "这首歌是专为她写的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6a620424-b620-4842-b596-9936dca85708", "text": "这首诗是匿名诗人写的。", "shortMeaning": "这首诗是无名诗人写的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e805e5ed-cdb2-40a0-ba38-7bbf4e43be00", "text": "这首诗是昨晚写的。", "shortMeaning": "这首诗写于昨晚。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d3895318-b306-4d42-8615-8cf1b2834f60", "text": "这首诗混合了诗歌和散文。", "shortMeaning": "这首诗诗和散文混着写。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2ab8006d-01d3-4f50-8654-c46e5c947f5e", "text": "这鬼地方本来人就少，晚上还能听见狼嚎，怪吓人的。", "shortMeaning": "这鬼地方人本来就少，晚上还听得见狼叫，挺吓人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f28867e2-5ef5-4527-984e-3e283cbe4287", "text": "这鸟你们用英语怎么称呼？", "shortMeaning": "这种鸟你们英语叫什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0eee0366-29fa-4831-a5e3-8f9767709a03", "text": "进一步的检查发现头骨受到剧烈的撞击而碎裂。", "shortMeaning": "进一步检查发现头骨受重击而碎裂。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c6090e42-a5c0-472c-81ca-6efce540a4ff", "text": "进入地球大气层后，小行星分裂成了无数的小块。", "shortMeaning": "小行星进了地球大气层后碎成无数小块。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ebef9907-001d-48fc-b7b3-7d9aa2ab0e98", "text": "进商店的人是我妹妹。", "shortMeaning": "进店的是我妹妹。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ae313751-bab1-41fe-996a-2f3f96721aaf", "text": "进家门后，我被垫子绊倒了。", "shortMeaning": "一进门我就被垫子绊倒。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:35ee54ab-a75d-4eda-be07-73d96382e6cd", "text": "进度条走完之后，会发生什么？", "shortMeaning": "进度条走完会怎样？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f96f16c4-bb41-4aef-a304-86287bc69bdd", "text": "进教室时请脱下帽子。", "shortMeaning": "进教室请摘帽。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b29e486d-d21a-412d-bd27-859d6c1d4a0c", "text": "进教室的时候请把帽子摘了。", "shortMeaning": "进教室时请把帽子摘下来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:70003a50-041a-4769-982b-c81174c95d65", "text": "远处有几座积雪的山峰。", "shortMeaning": "远处有几座积雪的山头。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1fc26623-e820-4bfd-9b8b-3f512d8e1ab8", "text": "远远地看见了光亮。", "shortMeaning": "远远望见一点光。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d36f28a2-2fd9-4eda-a518-cfc14dfc5840", "text": "连续下了好几天雨，所以这个足球场有些泥泞，不太好用了。", "shortMeaning": "连下了几天雨，这球场泥泞，不太好使了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1ceb5f28-d5b2-4be0-b2d1-b3d89cb725e1", "text": "迪克偶尔会上学迟到。", "shortMeaning": "迪克偶尔上学迟到。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:45707d2a-5f96-44d2-898b-12c2fc0a4af0", "text": "迪拜是一个低税收的经济体。", "shortMeaning": "迪拜是低税经济体。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9a6e6a1e-15a9-4a2c-b445-b68062162645", "text": "迫切的心情使她激动起来。", "shortMeaning": "急切的心情让她激动起来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e404c9ae-eae7-472d-9be2-93897dae602c", "text": "迷路的渔船安全地返回了港口。", "shortMeaning": "迷路的渔船平安回港。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6809bead-59ae-4d82-b933-4c856a96ffbc", "text": "追了一小段，警察抓到了他。", "shortMeaning": "追了一小段路，警察抓住了他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9604ddef-c3d8-4d24-a3a4-d807dd1f4e07", "text": "退休后他的收入少了一半。", "shortMeaning": "退休后他收入少了一半。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:242d5879-6500-4d93-bdf6-dd882a75be10", "text": "送比萨的人还没来。", "shortMeaning": "送披萨的还没到。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e381b5f6-ecbc-47d1-9274-361491e18d78", "text": "送这束花的人可能是佐藤小姐。", "shortMeaning": "送这束花的可能是佐藤小姐。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:57de1cad-4b9d-4871-86a5-2bf6d9114e97", "text": "适度的运动让身心焕然一新。", "shortMeaning": "适量运动让身心都清爽。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ae124b02-c301-4f03-9cf7-f3653999c9a7", "text": "逃避并不能解决问题。", "shortMeaning": "躲是解决不了问题的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:45d1a25c-c6a1-401a-a738-db77f9abba87", "text": "逆境顺境看襟度，临喜临怒看涵养。", "shortMeaning": "顺逆看胸襟，喜怒看修养。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:55274b41-bdaf-46b6-a948-4304cf60ba33", "text": "选手们的平均身高是多少？", "shortMeaning": "选手平均身高有多少？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
